    "updated_at": "2017-04-03T15:23:15Z",
    "body": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:General_Category_(Unicode) lists some categories, but it's not clear what to use for \"noncharacter\" other than the term (since the Cn category potentially includes other code points according to that page).\r\n\r\nIn http://ftp.unicode.org/Public/UNIDATA/PropList.txt I found mention of ASCII_hex_digit which could be useful, but none of the other groupings we need... This would probably require quite a bit of research.",
