    "created_at": "2017-04-03T15:44:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-03T15:44:04Z",
    "body": "I guess we could defer to Unicode more explicitly for control/noncharacter/surrogate per http://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode9.0.0/ch03.pdf (section 3.4 and references), but they're all fixed so I'm not sure it's worth it.\r\n\r\nCan't really find much on all the other ranges we have.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
