    "created_at": "2017-04-04T05:41:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-04T05:41:36Z",
    "body": "Control is outside ASCII too, but it's also defined as fixed by Unicode. I don't think anything we list is something that can change over time in Unicode. This would change if we imported HTML's White_Space, but that only has a single dependency and it's unclear whether it's implemented as such.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
